  "status_note": "Edition CONFIRMED (no 2025-26 revision found; bir.md s1). Key bindings CONFIRMED for the pin; selectors PARTIAL. Rule set r2 is a thin mapping: accounting measure to crosswalk input key (fill_class input) with lineage. Books holds no rate, election, threshold, applicability test, ATC choice, due date or penalty (ADR-0007).",
